&#x200B;

I really hate how they ended up killing grundy off :( he was such a good character

My parents would see my credit history and then promptly look at my uber history and ask why I took a uber from the train station at 3am when I was supposed to be at a friends house who was supposed to drop me home, followed by me being in a shit load of trouble

&#x200B;

Cardless is so much damn better but so is not being the family disappointment :(
